<StaticPageLayout
  title="Accessibility"
  seoTitle="TipPal — Accessibility"
  description="TipPal's commitment to accessibility and our conformance with WCAG 2.1 Level AA. How to report accessibility issues."
  lastUpdated="August 10, 2026"
  canonicalURL="/accessibility"
  hreflang={{ en: "/accessibility", es: "/es/accessibility" }}
>
  <section>
    <h3>Our commitment</h3>
    <p>TipPal Corp is committed to making our website and app usable by as many people as possible, including people with disabilities. We believe gratitude is for everyone, and that commitment extends to how we build our products.</p>
    <p>We aim to meet <strong>WCAG 2.1 Level AA</strong> as our accessibility standard. This means we work to ensure our interfaces are perceivable, operable, understandable, and robust across the assistive technologies people rely on.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>Scope</h3>
    <p>This statement covers the TipPal marketing website (www.tippalcorp.com). The TipPal mobile app has its own accessibility program and is evaluated separately as part of our product development cycle.</p>
    <p>We continuously review the site for:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Keyboard navigation — all interactive elements reachable and operable without a mouse.</li>
      <li>Visible focus indicators on links, buttons, and form controls.</li>
      <li>Text alternatives for all meaningful images.</li>
      <li>Color contrast that meets WCAG AA ratios (4.5:1 for normal text, 3:1 for large text).</li>
      <li>Semantic HTML and correct heading structure for screen readers.</li>
      <li>Resizable text without loss of content or function.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>Known limitations</h3>
    <p>While we strive for full conformance, some third-party content (such as app-store badges or embedded media) may be outside our direct control. We monitor these and work with our partners to improve them.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>Feedback</h3>
    <p>If you encounter an accessibility barrier on our site, please tell us so we can fix it. Email <a href="mailto:support@tippalcorp.com">support@tippalcorp.com</a> with "Accessibility" in the subject line and a description of what you found and where. We will acknowledge your report and work to resolve it.</p>
    <p>For privacy-related requests, contact <a href="mailto:info@tippalcorp.com">info@tippalcorp.com</a>.</p>
  </section>
</StaticPageLayout>